omplete Python Course</a></p><p>Student: Anjali Sharma\r\n</p><p>Paid amount: 1</p><p>Instructor: Amit Kumar</p></div>\n    ', '0', '1722853965', NULL), ('9', '8', '8', 'course_purchase', 'You have purchased a new course', '\n    <div>Course title: <a href=\"https://gyantech.online/home/course/complete-python-course/4\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Python Course</a>\r\nPaid amount: 1\r\nInstructor: Amit Kumar</div>\n    ', '0', '1722853965', NULL), ('10', '8', '2', 'course_purchase', 'A new course has been sold', '\n    <div>Course title: <a href=\"https://gyantech.online/home/course/complete-python-course/4\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Python Course</a>\r\nStudent: Anjali Sharma\r\nPaid amount: 1</div>\n    ', '0', '1722853965', NULL), ('11', '2', '2', 'signup', 'New user registered', '\n    <div>New user registered Vikash Shakya \r\n<br>User email: <b>vikash@gyantech.online</b></div>\n    ', '0', '1722862502', NULL), ('12', '2', '10', 'signup', 'Registered successfully', '\n    <div>You have successfully registered with us at Gyantech e-Learning Platform.</div>\n    ', '0', '1722862502', NULL), ('13', '2', '4', 'course_status', 'Activate this course', 'Hello sir,\r\nWe are testing this site right now.', '0', '1722874716', NULL);
